description:
SS\&C is a leading provider of mission\-critical, AI\-powered technology and services empowering financial services and healthcare organizations to work smarter, faster, and securely. Founded in 1986, SS\&C is headquartered in Windsor, Connecticut, and has offices worldwide. More than 23,000 financial services and healthcare organizations, from the world's largest companies to small and mid\-market firms, rely on SS\&C for expertise, scale, and technology.




**Job Description**
 Senior Associate / Associate Manager \- RFP Response / Due Diligence Support




 SS\&C GlobeOp Financial Services




 www.ssctech.com




 Afternoon Shift




 Job Location – Mumbai\- Goregaon




 Key Responsibilities:




* Manage the end\-to\-end DDQ process, including initial review, requirements gathering, content creation, and final submission;
* Handle Admin report requests, including initial review, requirements gathering, content creation, and final submission;
* Collaborate with business groups and other teams to gather information and create compelling and accurate responses;
* Maintain a library of standard responses, templates, and sales collateral to streamline the response creation process;
* Ensure that all assignments/responses align with company policies, brand guidelines, and regulatory requirements;
* Assist in developing and maintaining presentations, case studies, and other support materials;
* Track and report on daily activity, including volume analysis, response times, etc.;
* Pro\-active in automating process and deliverables through generating effective ideas that generate FTE savings and process efficiency
* Stay updated on industry trends, competitor activities, and market changes to enhance content.


 Unless explicitly requested or approached by SS\&C Technologies, Inc. or any of its affiliated companies, the company will not accept unsolicited resumes from headhunters, recruitment agencies, or fee\-based recruitment services.




 Applications will be accepted on an ongoing basis until the position is filled.




 SS\&C Technologies is an Equal Employment Opportunity employer and does not discriminate against any applicant for employment or employee on the basis of race, color, religious creed, gender, age, marital status, sexual orientation, national origin, disability, veteran status or any other classification protected by applicable discrimination laws.
